    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f9eba1568ea942d8886f89524e697121",
      "statement": "Options is func(*Claims) error; constructors include WithClaim, WithRootCA (computes the sha claim from a root file), WithSHA, WithSANS, WithStep, WithUserData (merges into the user claim), WithSSH (sets the step claim with provisioner.SignSSHOptions), WithConfirmationFingerprint, and WithFingerprint (builds the cnf claim from a CSR), plus WithValidity which validates boundaries against the Min/Max validity constants.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://token/options.go#L27-L32",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f83dc6e6b5bff83f6fc77bb51242a99db7d94830748718d08823c3b7f2011e6c:"
