      "statement": "token/options.go also provides WithIssuer, WithSubject, WithAudience, WithJWTID, WithKid (overrides the thumbprint kid), WithX5CFile/WithX5CCerts (set the x5c header), and WithNebulaCert (sets the nebula header); WithX5CInsecureCerts sets x5cAllowInvalid for self-signed chains.",
