      "statement": "token/parse.go defines the token Type enum (JWK, X5C, OIDC, GCP, AWS, Azure, K8sSA, Nebula) and Payload, which decodes standard claims plus sha/sans (JWK), at_hash/azp/email (OIDC), Azure claims, kubernetes.io/serviceaccount/* claims, and embedded GCP/AWS/Azure identity payloads; Payload.Type() classifies by google claim, amazon claim, Azure issuer, kubernetes/serviceaccount issuer, sha or sans presence, then OIDC-like standard claims.",
