      "statement": "TokenFlow defines eight signing types (SignType, RevokeType, SSHUserSignType, SSHHostSignType, SSHRevokeType, SSHRenewType, SSHRekeyType, RenewType) and parseAudience maps them to /1.0/sign, /1.0/renew, /1.0/revoke, /1.0/ssh/sign (both SSH sign types), /1.0/ssh/revoke, /1.0/ssh/renew, /1.0/ssh/rekey under the CA URL with the scheme forced to https, rejecting other schemes.",
