    {
      "id": "claim_52d72843b78e4338b4cc65089df1d49f",
      "statement": "NewTokenFlow applies flow options, builds the audience, skips provisioner discovery for RenewType (generateRenewToken), otherwise fetches provisioners via pki.GetProvisioners and prompts; it prompts for the subject unless the provisioner is OIDC (or SSH user sign uses a principal prompt), then dispatches JWK/OIDC/X5C/Nebula/SSHPOP/K8sSA to their generators, GCP/AWS/Azure to p.GetIdentityToken after copying DisableCustomSANs, and returns ACMETokenError or SCEPTokenError (carrying the provisioner name) for those provisioner types.",
