      "statement": "OfflineTokenFlow with --offline delegates to OfflineCA.GenerateToken when the --ca-config file exists, otherwise requires --provisioner/--issuer and --key (with optional --kid), derives the audience and root, and generates an X5C token when --x5c-cert/--x5c-key is set, otherwise a JWK token.",
