    {
      "id": "claim_43f039eefb45436aaa4a3906cf22ceb0",
      "statement": "provisionerPrompt filters provisioners by flags (--x5c-cert/--x5c-key to X5C, --sshpop-* to SSHPOP, --nebula-* to Nebula, --k8ssa-token-path to K8sSA; default lists JWK/OIDC/ACME/SCEP/K8sSA/X5C/SSHPOP/Nebula and cloud types), then by --kid (JWK KeyID or OIDC ClientID), --admin-provisioner, and --provisioner/--issuer by name, rendering per-type labels and auto-selecting a single candidate or prompting with ui.Select.",
