      "id": "claim_f5f17d88ee2e4f80b66527f07a414d50",
      "statement": "generateJWKToken uses loadJWK to obtain the signing JWK: from --key via cryptoutil.LoadJSONWebKey (KMS-aware), or from the CA — the provisioner encryptedKey from ca.json in offline mode or pki.GetProvisionerKey(caURL, root, kid) online — decrypted with a prompted password; the issuer is the provisioner name and the token type dispatches to SignToken/RevokeToken/SignSSHToken (user or host).",
