    {
      "id": "claim_38e43370bbd94d34a37a0ddd8bfa924b",
      "statement": "generateX5CToken requires --x5c-cert/--x5c-key, builds a KMS-aware signer, picks the JOSE algorithm via getSigningAlgorithm (ES256/384/512, RSA default, EdDSA; other keys error), appends --x5c-chain certs, sets the x5c header (or x5cAllowInvalid with --x5c-insecure), and uses audience <aud>#<provisioner ID>; generateNebulaToken reads the ed25519 CA key with jose.ReadKey and sets the nebula header with the same audience pattern; generateSSHPOPToken only supports SSH revoke/renew/rekey types with --sshpop-cert/--sshpop-key via token.WithSSHPOPFile.",
